#. Tag: title
#: install.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &kstars;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; is distributed with &kde; as part of the kdeedu \"Edutainment\" "
"module."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; is been packaged by many Linux/BSD distributions, including Fedora, "
"openSUSE, Ubuntu, and Mandriva. Some distributions package &kstars; as a "
"separate application, some just provide a kdeedu package, which includes "
"&kstars;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: install.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you would like the latest Git development version of &kstars;, please "
"follow <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/Projects/Edu/KStars/"
"Building_KStars\">these instructions</ulink>."
msgstr ""

